msgid "Open-shell coupled cluster theories"
msgstr "开壳层耦合簇理论"

msgid ""
"Spin unrestricted (``RHF-UCCSD``) and partially spin restricted (``RHF-"
"RCCSD``) open-shell coupled cluster theories as described in `J. Chem. Phys."
" <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465990>`__ **99**, 5219 (1993) (see also "
"`erratum <http://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.480886>`__, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.480886>`__ **112**, 3106 (2000)) are available"
" in Molpro. In both cases a high-spin ``RHF`` reference wavefunction is "
"used. Coupled cluster methods based on UHF orbitals are implemented in "
"Molpro for a number of methods as well, including ``CCD``,\\ ``CCSD``, "
"``CCSD(T)``,\\ ``MP2-4``, ``CISD`` and ``DCSD``."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 中提供了自旋非限制（\\ ``RHF-UCCSD``\\ ）和部分自旋限制（\\ ``RHF-RCCSD``\\ "
"）的开壳层耦合簇理论，其描述见 `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.465990>`__ "
"**99**, 5219 (1993)（另见 `勘误 <http://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.480886>`__, `J. "
"Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.480886>`__ **112**, 3106 "
"(2000)）。两种情况下均使用高自旋 ``RHF`` 参考波函数。Molpro 中也基于 UHF 轨道实现了一系列方法的耦合簇方法，包括 "
"``CCD``,\\ ``CCSD``, ``CCSD(T)``,\\ ``MP2-4``, ``CISD`` 和 ``DCSD``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"In the ``RCCSD`` theory certain restrictions among the amplitudes are "
"introduced, such that the linear part of the wavefunction becomes a spin "
"eigenfunction (this is not the case in the ``UCCSD`` method, even if an "
"``RHF`` reference function is used). At present, the implementation of "
"``RCCSD`` is only preliminary, and no CPU time is saved by as compared to "
"``UCCSD``. However, improved algorithms, as described in the above "
"publication, are currently being implemented, and will be available in the "
"near future."
msgstr ""
"在 ``RCCSD`` 理论中，对振幅施加了某些限制，使得波函数的线性部分成为自旋本征函数（这在 ``UCCSD`` 方法中并非如此，即使使用了 "
"``RHF`` 参考函数）。目前，\\ ``RCCSD`` 的实现仅是初步的，与 ``UCCSD`` 相比并未节省 CPU "
"时间。然而，如上文出版物所述，改进的算法目前正在实现中，并将在不久的将来提供。"

msgid ""
"The input and the options are exactly the same as for closed-shell ``CCSD``,"
" except that ``RCCSD`` or ``UCCSD`` are used as keywords. By default, the "
"open-shell orbitals are the same as used in the ``RHF`` reference function, "
"but this can be modified using ``OCC``, ``CLOSED``, and ``WF`` cards."
msgstr ""
"输入和选项与闭壳层 ``CCSD`` 完全相同，只是使用 ``RCCSD`` 或 ``UCCSD`` 作为关键词。默认情况下，开壳层轨道与 "
"``RHF`` 参考函数中使用的相同，但可以使用 ``OCC``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED`` 和 ``WF`` 卡片进行修改。"

msgid ""
"Distinguishable cluster calculations can be performed using ``RDCSD`` or "
"``UDCSD`` commands. The SCS correction is calculated as defined by D. Kats, "
"`Mol. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2017.1417646>`__ **116**, "
"1435 (2018)."
msgstr ""
"可区分簇计算可以使用 ``RDCSD`` 或 ``UDCSD`` 命令执行。SCS 校正的计算遵循 D. Kats 的定义，\\ `Mol. Phys."
" <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2017.1417646>`__ **116**, 1435 (2018)。"

msgid "Perturbative triples corrections are computed as follows:"
msgstr "微扰三重激发校正的计算如下："

msgid ""
"``RCCSD(T), UCCSD(T)`` triples corrections are computed as defined by J. D. "
"Watts, J. Gauss and R. J. Bartlett, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.464480>`__ **98**, 8718 (1993)."
msgstr ""
"``RCCSD(T), UCCSD(T)`` 三重激发校正的计算遵循 J. D. Watts, J. Gauss 和 R. J. Bartlett "
"的定义，\\ `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.464480>`__ **98**, 8718"
" (1993)。"

msgid ""
"``RCCSD[T], UCCSD[T]`` corrections are computed without contributions of "
"single excitations [sometimes called CCSD+T(CCSD)]. These slightly differ "
"from the [T] corrections defined by `Watts et al. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.464480>`__ in that the contributions from "
":math:`X^{ijk}_{abc}` are not included."
msgstr ""
"``RCCSD[T], UCCSD[T]`` 校正的计算不包含单激发贡献 [有时称为 CCSD+T(CCSD)]。这些校正与 `Watts 等人 "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.464480>`__ 定义的 [T] 校正略有不同，因为不包含来自 "
":math:`X^{ijk}_{abc}` 的贡献。"

msgid ""
"``RCCSD-T, UCCSD-T`` triples corrections are computed as defined by M. J. O."
" Deegan and P. J. Knowles, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(94)00815-9>`__ **227**, 321 (1994)."
msgstr ""
"``RCCSD-T, UCCSD-T`` 三重激发校正的计算依据 M. J. O. Deegan 和 P. J. Knowles 的定义，\\ "
"`Chem. Phys. Lett. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(94)00815-9>`__ "
"**227**, 321 (1994)。"

msgid ""
"All three contributions are always computed and printed. The following "
"variables are used to store the results (here ``CCSD`` stands for either "
"``UCCSD`` or ``RCCSD``):"
msgstr "所有三项贡献总是被计算并输出。以下变量用于存储结果（此处 ``CCSD`` 代表 ``UCCSD`` 或 ``RCCSD``\\ ）："

msgid "``ENERGY`` total energy for method specified in the input."
msgstr "``ENERGY`` 输入中指定方法的总能量。"

msgid "``ENERGC`` total ``CCSD`` energy without triples."
msgstr "``ENERGC`` 不含三重激发的总 ``CCSD`` 能量。"

msgid "``ENERGT(1)`` total ``CCSD(T)`` energy."
msgstr "``ENERGT(1)`` 总 ``CCSD(T)`` 能量。"

msgid "``ENERGT(2)`` total ``CCSD[T]`` energy."
msgstr "``ENERGT(2)`` 总 ``CCSD[T]`` 能量。"

msgid "``ENERGT(3)`` total ``CCSD-T`` energy."
msgstr "``ENERGT(3)`` 总 ``CCSD-T`` 能量。"

msgid ""
"It should be noted that in open-shell cases the triples energy slightly "
"depends on the treatment of core orbitals. In Molpro pseudo-canonical alpha "
"and beta spin orbitals [`Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0009-2614(91)85118-G>`__ **186**, 130 (1991)] "
"are generated by block-diagonalizing the corresponding Fock matrices in the "
"space of valence orbitals, leaving frozen core orbitals untouched. Some "
"other programs include the frozen core orbitals in the canonicalization and "
"transformation. Because of core-valence mixing this leads to slightly "
"different energies. Neither of the two methods can be regarded as better or "
"more justified — it is just a matter of definition. However, the method in "
"Molpro is more efficient since the subsequent integral transformation "
"involves only valence orbitals and no core orbitals."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，在开壳层情况下，三重激发能略微依赖于芯轨道的处理方式。在Molpro中，通过在价层轨道空间中对相应的Fock矩阵进行块对角化，生成赝正则化的α和β自旋轨道[`Chem."
" Phys. Lett. <http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0009-2614(91)85118-G>`__ **186**, "
"130 (1991)]，而冻结芯轨道保持不变。其他一些程序在正则化和变换过程中包含了冻结芯轨道。由于芯-"
"价混合，这会导致能量略有不同。这两种方法都不能被视为更好或更合理——这只是定义的问题。然而，Molpro中的方法更高效，因为后续的积分变换仅涉及价层轨道，不涉及芯轨道。"

msgid ""
"Spin-unrestricted coupled cluster calculations using UHF orbitals can be "
"done using the input options"
msgstr "使用UHF轨道的自旋非限制耦合簇计算可以通过以下输入选项完成"

msgid ""
"The spin-unrestricted coupled cluster code can also handle spin-restricted "
"references, yet, by default the restricted open-shell coupled cluster code "
"is executed when the previous SCF calculation was of RHF type. In order to "
"force the execution of the unrestricted code one can set the option "
"``UHF_UCCSD=1`` to the ``UCCSD`` command. It should be noted, however, that "
"there is little to choose between the two different codes performance wise "
"for RHF references."
msgstr ""
"自旋非限制耦合簇代码也可以处理自旋限制参考态，然而，默认情况下，当先前的SCF计算是RHF类型时，会执行限制性开壳层耦合簇代码。为了强制执行非限制性代码，可以将选项\\"
" ``UHF_UCCSD=1``\\ 设置给\\ ``UCCSD``\\ "
"命令。但需要注意的是，对于RHF参考态，在性能方面这两种不同代码之间几乎没有选择余地。"

msgid "Open-Shell Coupled cluster calculation on CN"
msgstr "CN分子的开壳层耦合簇计算"
